SUMMARY:Singers & Songs - A Collaboration of WNC Vocalists
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Singers & Songs\, a special evening celebrating the art of songwriting and the voices behind it. \nFeaturing a lineup led by some of Western North Carolina’s most captivating vocalists\, this intimate showcase brings together original music\, storytelling\, and unexpected collaborations in the listening-room setting of Hotel Eve. \nFeaturing: \nReggie Headen \nCara Morgan \nRuth Cooney \nMary Kay Williams \nCarole Marcotte \nWendy Jones \n+ Additional Special Guests! \nCurated by Hollie Baines alongside Taylor Pierson (Keys)\, Steve LaSpina (bass) and Rick Dilling (Drums) \n$10 weekdays -$15 weekends at the door (all ticket proceeds are 100% passed to the band\, backed by a living wage guarantee from Hotel Eve) \n*Reserve a table in advance\, or join us impromptu the night of the show. Reservations/advance tickets are recommended for preferred seating\, but not required. Tickets are available at the door on a first-come\, first-served basis.  Event Details and Tickets \nHotel Eve is your locally rooted\, speakeasy jazz club & cocktail bar\, hidden in the heart of Downtown Asheville. Mysteriously not a hotel…check in for spirits\, souls and jazz! We’re tucked away\, on purpose. You’ll find us behind the gate nestled between Virtue Boutique and Dane Wells Gallery at 56 N Lexington Avenue in downtown Asheville. Step through\, take a left into the courtyard\, check in for Spirits\, Souls & Jazz. We’ll be waiting on the other side. hotelevejazz.com \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/singers-songs-a-collaboration-of-wnc-vocalists/
LOCATION:Hotel Eve Jazz\, 56 N Lexington Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/733963859_1041914445452303_6804587520729418688_n-e1782675623759.jpg
GEO:35.5967716;-82.5530826
